      "title": {
        "en": "Exceptional and accommodating pet sitter"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners overwhelmingly commend Calleigh for her extraordinary warmth, trustworthiness, and dedication. Clients appreciate that she readily accommodates last-minute boarding requests and handles high-stress travel schedules with flexibility. Reviewers emphasize that Calleigh treats every visiting dog and cat like a member of her own family."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 32,
      "title": {
        "en": "Comfortable environment for sensitive animals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report that anxious rescue dogs, reactive bully breeds, and timid cats settle in comfortably and thrive during overnight stays on Lappin Avenue. Reviewers appreciate that pets receive personalized attention and gentle patience suited to their individual temperaments. Owners note picking up happy, relaxed animals after long trips."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 27,
      "title": {
        "en": "Frequent photo and video updates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners consistently highlight the continuous stream of detailed text messages, photos, and video updates sent throughout their pets' boarding stays. Clients note that these reassuring daily dispatches provide great peace of mind while away on vacation or work trips. Reviewers describe communication as exceptionally prompt and transparent."
      }
    }
  ],
